element of the charge. The rider's own advocate does not press POL-NS-04 and accepts there is no shortfall, no false marker and no wrong-entrance case.\n\nTHE CHAT LOG (EV-CHAT-00208, full weight) matches the instruments throughout: system arrival notice 16:02:26, the driver's plate and location 16:02:40 and 16:07:15, every message read, and the rider's 'coming coming 2 min' at 16:08:02.\n\nTHE MONEY. The booking was RYDE_XL. The fare schedule's resolution rule gives the greater of the SGD 4.00 LARGE_VENUE zone-class fee and the SGD 8.00 vehicle-tier fee = SGD 8.00, which is exactly the cancellation-fee line itemised (EV-FARE-00208, payment status CHARGED, difference 0.00), so POL-NS-08(d) is not engaged and the fee stands. Under POL-NS-07 the driver is compensated at 80 percent of that fee: SGD 6.40, with SGD 1.60 (20 percent) retained as the platform service fee. The anti-farming check does not trip: the driver has 2 no-show terminations in 30 days (threshold 4 or more) and a ratio of 2/143 = 0.014 against 143 completed trips (threshold above 0.08), so both limbs are clear and compensation is paid. Per POL-GEN-03, on a DRIVER_COMPENSATION ruling amount_sgd carries the same SGD 6.40 figure; it is the amount the ruling moves, not a refund to the rider, and the rider's charge is not reversed.\n\nPROFILE POINTS. The rider's prior_no_show_flags of 3 is a lifetime counter and is CONTEXT ONLY under POL-GEN-01; it is not used as a ground and may not be substituted for no_show_disputes_30d, which stands at 1, below the POL-NS-09(d) threshold of 3. No escalation ground is available: no admissible artifacts contradict one another (POL-NS-09(b)); disputes_with_counterparty_90d is 0 on both profiles (POL-NS-09(c)); the anti-farming check does not trip (POL-NS-09(d)); and no deciding artifact is impaired under POL-NS-08 (clock skew is 15 seconds, well under 90; the trace has no gap; the chat has all 6 messages the trip record counts; the fare reconciles), so POL-NS-09(e) is not engaged either.\n\nTHE MISSING ADVISORY. EV-ADVIS-00208-01 is MISSING with weight 0.0 and issue code MISSING_ARTIFACT; it carries no fact and is relied on by nothing in this ruling. Its absence is not held against either party and no waiting-clock accumulation under POL-NS-06(i) is needed, because the driver's time in the geofence is a single unbroken run.\n\nCONFIDENCE. The deciding facts — the driver's arrival inside the radius, the 585-second continuous dwell, and the RIDER_NO_SHOW termination — are carried by the GPS trace and the trip record, both at weight_multiplier 1.0, so the cap under POL-GEN-02(2) is 1.0; no artifact carrying a deciding fact is impaired. Confidence is set at 0.95, above the 0.70 floor, so no escalation is required.",
